description: >-
  Keyword **extesttab** — run expgtest for named (or catalog-23) scopes N times,
  assign sequential Ex-run ids, write iteration tables (with scope+word detail
  when 1–4 scopes remain) into EXPGTEST_CATALOG_SCOREBOARD.md, pairwise compare,
  optional baseline compare to a prior Ex-run.
alwaysApply: false
