<h2 id="when" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">1. When this applies</h2>

User message includes **`extesttab`** (whole token).

**Parse (do this first):**

| Piece | How it appears | Default if omitted |
|-------|----------------|--------------------|
| **`{scope_list}`** | Bare scope names after `extesttab`, `scopes: a,b`, comma-separated catalog ids | **All 23 non-conj scopes** (`--catalog-23`) |
| **Run count** | `2 times`, `×3`, `3 runs` | **2** |
| **`compare to {Ex-run #}`** | `compare to Ex-run 1`, `compare to 1`, `vs Ex-run 3` | **None** — skip baseline triple table |

Warn on unknown scope names; intersect with catalog. Do **not** invent conjugation / PLGW scopes.

