<h2 id="scoreboard" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">4. Scoreboard write shape</h2>

**File:** `docs/pglpl/EXPGTEST_CATALOG_SCOREBOARD.md`

Each new Ex-run section includes:

- Anchor `id="ex-run-N"`
- Run stamp, summary stamp, log path, wall duration
- **Run summary** table (Ex-run, stamp, wall, status, scopes cleared, iters used, log filename)
- **Iteration breakdown** table (see [Table columns](#tables))
- Optional note (branch, harness flags, blocked reason)

Compare sections:

- `id="compare-N-M"` — pairwise between two Ex-runs from this session
- `id="compare-baseline-N-M-B"` — triple table: baseline Ex-run B vs new Ex-runs N and M

Use mrkd palette (#1565c0 headers, #e3f2fd aspect column, green/amber/red body rows).

