<h2 id="tables" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">5. Table columns</h2>

**Iteration breakdown (per Ex-run):**

<table>
<thead>
<tr style="background:#1565c0;color:white"><th>Column</th><th>Source</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Phase</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9">Top <code>Phase: Init</code> row (baseline counts before Iter 1), then Iter 1 … Iter K + Total</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Wall</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9">Door B Wall + Door C Wall; Total uses harness <code>elapsed_s</code> (Init row uses em dash)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Door B Wall / Door C Wall / Door B Max Sub Iter</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9"><code>[expgtest] phase=door_b|door_c</code> log lines + iter JSON + chunk attempts max</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Scopes remained at end</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9">Count of scopes with <code>remain&gt;0</code> at end of iter (Init row = starting scopes count)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Words remained at end</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9">Sum of per-scope remain counts at end of iter (Init row = total pool words count)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Paragraphs remained at end</td><td style="background:#fff8e1">Planned paragraph count at end of iter (Init row = initial planned paragraphs)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Remaining scopes + words (1–4 scopes only)</td><td style="background:#fff8e1"><code>min-width:38%</code>; <code>scope</code> (n): labels [id=…]; <strong>—</strong> when scopes ≥5 or 0</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Door Jud A / B (model)</td><td style="background:#fff8e1">ISSUE text from Door C artifact on last iter, or <code>[Failed-Before-Reach]</code> if Door C was skipped/not reached (e.g. Door B produced 0 valid rows)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">LLM calls</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9"><code>[LLM-REQUEST]</code> or attempts×2 fallback</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Alt verify (model / calls)</td><td style="background:#fff8e1"><code>[VERIFY-ALT-MODEL]</code> per **outer TL-Itr** chunk when <code>tl_itr &gt; threshold</code> (not inner sub-attempt); e.g. <code>gpt-4.1 / 12</code> or <code>— / 0</code></td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Other Errors</td><td style="background:#fff3e0">Grouped count &amp; breakdown of abnormal errors (HTTP 429, Network 5xx/timeouts, Python Code exceptions); <code>0</code> when clean</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

**Pairwise / triple compare (important attributes only):** run stamp, wall, status, scopes cleared, outer iters, cardinals remain (end).

