<h2 id="examples" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">7. Examples</h2>

```text
extesttab, 2 times
→ catalog-23 ×2; Ex-run 3 + 4; pairwise table; scoreboard updated.

extesttab numbers:cardinals, contractions:blending, 2 times
→ two scoped runs; iteration tables show scope+word detail when ≤4 scopes remain.

extesttab, 2 times, compare to Ex-run 1
→ catalog-23 ×2 as Ex-run 3 + 4; pairwise 3 vs 4; triple compare vs Ex-run 1 baseline.
```

